# Open Banking synthetic data (T20): about 47 MB of generated JSON; regenerate with ob_generator.py. A sample is committed:
# persona001 (BNPL), persona029 (one account, unarranged overdraft), persona072 (seven accounts, three providers),
# persona082 (joint account, two cards), persona100 (credit card, unarranged overdraft).
Analysis/open_banking/persona*.json
!Analysis/open_banking/persona001_*.json
!Analysis/open_banking/persona029_*.json
!Analysis/open_banking/persona072_*.json
!Analysis/open_banking/persona082_*.json
!Analysis/open_banking/persona100_*.json

